<div class="hero"><span class="flag">🇬🇧</span><h1>From the UK to China for Surgery: Skip NHS Waits, Save 50–70%</h1><p>The NHS is world-class — but waits for elective surgery now reach 6–12 months. China offers comparable clinical quality at 50–70% less than UK private care, with JCI-accredited hospitals, English-speaking staff, and scheduling in 2–4 weeks.</p><a href="/contact-new.html?source=uk-landing" class="btn-red">Start Free Case Review &rarr;</a></div>

