<div class="card"><h2>Why Brits Choose China for Treatment</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Skip the queue:</strong> China schedules elective procedures in 2–4 weeks, versus 6–12 month NHS waits for joint replacement and cardiac surgery.</li><li><strong>30-day visa-free:</strong> UK citizens enjoy 30-day visa-free entry (since February 2026, trial through 31 Dec 2026).</li><li><strong>Direct flights:</strong> 10–11 hours non-stop from London Heathrow to Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou on multiple daily services.</li><li><strong>English-speaking doctors:</strong> All recommended hospitals have international departments with fluent English staff.</li><li><strong>JCI accreditation:</strong> Top Chinese hospitals meet the same standards as leading private UK hospitals.</li></ul></div>

